# Data files
# Runtime DB lives at public/medications.json (committed).
# data/lupa_medication_db.json is a build artifact (identical content), skip.
# BOE PDFs are large source documents — re-download from BOE permalinks
#   https://www.boe.es/diario_boe/txt.php?id=BOE-A-2025-20356
#   https://www.boe.es/diario_boe/txt.php?id=BOE-A-2025-21925
# Parsed CSVs (boe_anexo_1_full.csv, boe_errata.csv, boe_errata_raw.txt)
# ARE committed — they are the canonical extracted form, useful in diffs.
data/nomenclator.csv
data/nomenclator-*.csv
data/boe-*.pdf
data/lupa_medication_db.json
data/boe_raw_sample.txt

